		{
			"id":"125fd7df9ded1357",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Contact ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1240,
			"y":1180,
			"width":160,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"86c05acb648202d8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. workflow started\n\t1. input\n\t\t1. Contact id\n\t\t2. contact name\n\t\t3. company name\n\t\t4. email\n\t\t5. number\n\t\t6. list of product details\n\t\t7. questionarries\n2. Form Create\n\t1. Products details\n\t\t1. selection box\n\t2. questions\n\t\t1. selection box\n3. Form Review\n\t1. yes\n\t\t1. Email create\n\t\t2. Email review \n\t2. no\n\t\t1. Regenerate email by adding comment\n4. Email send with form attached\n\t1. Responded in form within 7 days? \n\t\t1. Move to outreach\n\t2. Not Responded within 7 days? \n\t\t1. Send follow up mail\n\t\t\t1. If yes move to outreach\n\t\t\t2. If no end workflow. ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1380,
			"y":1380,
			"width":460,
			"height":800
		},
		{
			"id":"dbc7a56c82c796cc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Outreach mail agent\n\t1. Ask user what to include in mail? something like meeting time slots for interested products\n2. Email review\n\t1. Edit\n\t\t1. Add comments and regenerate\n\t2. approve\n\t\t1. send mail\n3. Send\n\t1. Time slot confirmed by customer\n\t\t1. Discovery\n\t2. Others\n\t\t1. follow-up \n\t\t\t1. time confirmation?",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-820,
			"y":1380,
			"width":460,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"b26ad17d1628d537",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. Given time slot review\n2. Confirm\n\t1. meeting scheduled \n3. Meeting completed\n\t1. Transcript \n\t2. meeting summary \n4. END WORKFLOW",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-200,
			"y":1400,
